WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:02.990
Unit eighteen. Hot Weather!

2
00:00:03.967 --> 00:00:07.856
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.906 --> 00:00:11.712
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.762 --> 00:00:15.464
Today we learn about Hot Weather. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.331 --> 00:00:19.398
Hot. Say it with me. Hot!

6
00:00:22.901 --> 00:00:26.251
Sun. Say it with me. Sun!

7
00:00:29.753 --> 00:00:33.286
Shade. Say it with me. Shade!

8
00:00:36.773 --> 00:00:40.123
Water. Say it with me. Water!

9
00:00:43.627 --> 00:00:46.727
Hat. Say it with me. Hat!

10
00:00:50.224 --> 00:00:53.490
Tired. Say it with me. Tired!

11
00:00:57.027 --> 00:01:00.243
Headache. Say it with me. Headache!

12
00:01:03.718 --> 00:01:07.084
Cool. Say it with me. Cool!

13
00:01:10.586 --> 00:01:19.651
On very hot days, I play in the shade and wear a hat. I drink lots of water. If I feel tired or have a headache, I rest somewhere cool and tell an adult.

14
00:01:19.701 --> 00:01:20.901
I can do that too!

15
00:01:22.154 --> 00:01:27.394
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:27.444 --> 00:01:28.594
Shade!

17
00:01:29.348 --> 00:01:34.632
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:34.682 --> 00:01:35.832
Headache!

19
00:01:36.743 --> 00:01:42.910
Did you know? The sun is strongest in the middle of the day, so shade is extra important then!

20
00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:45.126
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:46.510 --> 00:01:54.145
Think and answer. How do you know your body is too hot?

22
00:01:54.195 --> 00:01:55.345
Great answer!

23
00:01:56.473 --> 00:02:01.227
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:01.277 --> 00:02:03.865
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

